How to include








Form
Search Order
Use Case




#include &lt;header&gt;
System include paths only
Standard library headers or third-party libraries installed in system paths.


#include "header"
Current directory first, then system include paths
Project-specific headers or headers in the same directory.


#include &lt;folder/header&gt;
System include paths only
Third-party libraries with organized subdirectories.


#include "folder/header"
Current directory first, then system include paths
Project-specific headers in subdirectories.


#include &lt;absolute/path&gt;
No search; directly includes the file from the specified absolute path
Rarely used; for debugging or non-standard locations.


#include "relative/path"
Current directory or relative to the file, then system include paths
Headers in parent or sibling directories.
